      "content": "oh wow i didnt realize it was that serious. i was worried i'd have to give up all my favorite foods. are there like... safer ways to get that protein? like if i just buy the regular kind of cheese or deli meat instead of the aged/cured stuff, is that fine? i really dont want to miss out on protein while i'm trying to feel better.",
