      "content": "thanks that makes me feel way better. i was stressing out. actually i have one more thing... i've been feeling a little bit of a headache lately, probably just from the stress of everything, but i was thinking of taking some of that pseudoephedrine stuff (the decongestant kind) just to clear my head and feel more awake for my workouts. is that cool to take with my current meds? it should be fine since it's just for a headache right?",
